{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n '\"'^#|77b|slice 2'\"' docs/CURRENT_STATE.md | tail -65; rg -n '\"'^#'\"' AGENTS.md; ls -la poc/data/release-{screen-2026-11-23b,check-2026-11-23i}\"","aggregated_output":"1:# Current state\n103:## Future evidence scoring (D372)\n107:## Latest decision (D369)\n128:## What runs\n140:## Open defects\n159:## One next task\n448:**The one next task: slice 2 of the \"Forecast unavailable\" release, the reader's screen (D758 order; D756's screen check).** The release\n881:  - stage 0 and slice 2;\n1:# Hivemind: working rules\n9:## Where to look first\n27:## Authority and scope\n59:## 1. Before acting on a failure: diagnose\n91:## 2. Before writing code: design\n122:## 3. Writing code\n145:## 4. Tests\n168:## 5. Verification\n194:## 6. Writing prompts\n237:## 7. Measuring and iterating\n239:### 7.1 The ruler\n292:### 7.2 Reading results\n326:### 7.3 Iterating\n388:## 8. Product thinking\n419:## 9. Workspace and operations\n449:## 10. Rebuilding from ../tn-hivemind\n456:## 11. Design documents and decisions\n485:## Before finishing a slice\npoc/data/release-check-2026-11-23i:\ntotal 2216\ndrwxr-xr-x@   7 lchingen  staff      224 Nov 23 12:08 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 262 lchingen  staff     8384 Nov 23 12:06 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@   9 lchingen  staff      288 Nov 23 12:07 old-1\ndrwxr-xr-x@   4 lchingen  staff      128 Nov 23 12:06 old-2\ndrwxr-xr-x@   6 lchingen  staff      192 Nov 23 12:07 old-3\n-rw-r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff  1130607 Nov 23 12:08 results.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@   4 lchingen  staff      128 Nov 23 12:07 served\n\npoc/data/release-screen-2026-11-23b:\ntotal 2280\ndrwxr-xr-x@  22 lchingen  staff     704 Nov 23 12:15 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 262 lchingen  staff    8384 Nov 23 12:06 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@   4 lchingen  staff     128 Nov 23 12:04 .escape-stores\ndrwx------@   5 lchingen  staff     160 Nov 23 12:04 escape\n-rw-------@   1 lchingen  staff     706 Nov 23 12:04 escape.report.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@   3 lchingen  staff      96 Nov 23 12:05 mutant-clipped\ndrwxr-xr-x@   3 lchingen  staff      96 Nov 23 12:05 mutant-clipping-wrapper\ndrwxr-xr-x@   3 lchingen  staff      96 Nov 23 12:04 mutant-fetch\ndrwxr-xr-x@   3 lchingen  staff      96 Nov 23 12:04 mutant-line-beside\ndrwxr-xr-x@   3 lchingen  staff      96 Nov 23 12:04 mutant-line-inside\ndrwxr-xr-x@   3 lchingen  staff      96 Nov 23 12:05 mutant-own-background\ndrwxr-xr-x@   3 lchingen  staff      96 Nov 23 12:04 mutant-transparent\ndrwxr-xr-x@   3 lchingen  staff      96 Nov 23 12:05 mutant-unreadable-marker\ndrwx------@   5 lchingen  staff     160 Nov 23 12:04 old-1\ndrwx------@   5 lchingen  staff     160 Nov 23 12:04 old-1-0828\n-rw-------@   1 lchingen  staff     471 Nov 23 12:04 old-1-0828.report.json\n-rw-r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff  258597 Nov 23 12:15 old-1-v8.png\n-rw-------@   1 lchingen  staff     471 Nov 23 12:04 old-1.report.json\ndrwx------@   5 lchingen  staff     160 Nov 23 12:04 old-3-0825\n-rw-------@   1 lchingen  staff     471 Nov 23 12:04 old-3-0825.report.json\n-rw-r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff  884488 Nov 23 12:04 screen-expected.json\n-rw-r--r--@   1 lchingen  staff    3588 Nov 23 12:15 screen-results.json\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
